\u003ePerfect for cat moms, cat dads, and anyone who needs a satisfying break from reality.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMeow-velous features await! 🎯\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ 25+ Adorable Kitty Heroes to Collect\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom fluffy snipers to shotgun-wielding tabbies — each kitty has its own personality and special abilities.\\u003cbr\\u003eCuteness + power + personality... what more could a cat lover ask for?\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your dream squad and watch them become unstoppable!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ 35+ Guns to Master — Cute Shooter, Real Firepower\\u003cbr\\u003ePistols, rifles, shotguns, miniguns! Your kitties auto-fire through enemies with pure feline precision.\\u003cbr\\u003ePew pew! Boom boom! Every shot feels SO satisfying in this idle shooter RPG.\\u003cbr\\u003eAdorable looks, devastating firepower — the gap is everything.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ Gun Merge System — The Most Addictive Mechanic\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge identical guns to forge higher-tier weapons. The bigger the gun, the cuter the kitty holding it!\\u003cbr\\u003eThat sweet, sweet feeling of every successful merge... this is what idle RPG perfection feels like.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ Rebirth System — Infinite Growth, Infinite Kitties\\u003cbr\\u003eHit milestone stages and rebirth for game-changing abilities.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe more you rebirth, the stronger your squad grows — classic idle game progression at its finest!\\u003cbr\\u003eOffline rewards keep your fluffy gunners earning power 24/7, even while you sleep.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ Diverse Maps — From Cozy Forests to Snowy Peaks\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore forests, deserts, snowfields, and beyond with your gunner squad.\\u003cbr\\u003eBigger challenges, bigger rewards, bigger explosions await!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 This game is purr-fect for...\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Cat moms and dads who can\\u0026#39;t walk past a kitty without saying \\u0026quot;awww\\u0026quot;\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Idle game fans looking for their next addictive obsession\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Shooter game enthusiasts who want something cuter than the usual\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Busy people needing a satisfying break during commutes or coffee runs\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Players who love merge mechanics and auto battle systems\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Anyone who thinks \\u0026quot;cats with guns\\u0026quot; is the best concept ever\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Fans of idle RPG, idle hero games, and casual one-hand gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to lead the cutest, deadliest army of kitties ever assembled?\\u003cbr\\u003eYour fluffy gunner squad is waiting. Time to make some noise! 🐱🔫💥\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Idle Cat Gunner now!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e-----\\u003cbr\\u003e📩 Support: support@neptunecompany.kr \\u003cbr\\u003e📄 Terms of Service: https://neptunecompany.kr/gameterms\\u003cbr\\u003e🔒 Privacy Policy: https://neptunecompany.kr/gameprivacy\"],\"NEPTUNE(TREEPLLA)\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1jFVH1ucrVd2ljIga96EmrnmuMiNHdGRJ2f03kj47KTtRdXVICiHZqz5bvCqsQCgRqsk5Mq4bGb6LuQqUloR\"],null,[109,129,63,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],nul