LyygPVYy2mTWVPIKnvCNoUfm6wHg8BGdJPGYrrkg7RKC_rv3UyAe3MdxcKlZaI5zxsAGv32yuKJrq1kKUS8\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SywLAZh60tOWUlOeVq5xFN2AJ-L3eg0iz3dQ1vbsXv_osT0Ht2jBDqrhNX1uvp33ucseWA80LWRmd8CrClrl\"]]],\"Happy Screw Trip 3D®: ASMR\",[\"4.4\",4.428571],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gamebp.screw3d\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.gamebp.screw3d\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gamebp.screw3d\"]],[\"qgJiGmAIIEoTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tR0IQALoCNAoYChJjb20uZ2FtZWJwLnNjcmV3M2QQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Enter the Captivating ASMR Universe of Happy Screw Trip 3D! A 3D puzzle adventure blending strategy and spatial logic, designed for players who crave mental challenges! Sort colorful screws, master intricate layouts, and embark on a journey of creativity and accomplishment—perfect for unwinding or pushing your cognitive limits!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGameplay Essentials:\\u003cbr\\u003e1. Analyze \\u0026amp; Plan: Study screw arrangements across pillars and devise your strategy.  \\u003cbr\\u003e2. Color Coordination: Transfer screws to matching zones—precision is key to avoid deadlocks!\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Spatial Mastery: Navigate obstacles and optimize space to unlock advanced techniques.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy Happy Screw Trip 3D Stands Out?\\u003cbr\\u003e- Universal Appeal: Casual players or puzzle enthusiasts—flexible difficulty levels cater to all skill sets!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Brainpower Boost: Sharpen logic, spatial reasoning, and strategic planning through evolving challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play Your Way: No timers, no pressure. Enjoy smooth drag-and-rotate controls with realistic physics.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Strategic Tool Kits: Expand storage with \\u0026quot;Capacity Boxes\\u0026quot;, unlock flexible layouts via \\u0026quot;Multi-Slot\\u0026quot; tools—combine creatively to dominate stages!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Diverse Level Design: 100+ unique stages with randomized elements for endless replayability!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Minimalist Aesthetics: Clean visuals and calming soundscapes enhance focus and relaxation.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Happy Screw Trip 3D Now and Redefine Puzzle Mastery! Whether for a quick brain teaser or an immersive session, this game is your gateway to strategic joy. Start your journey as the ASMR screw master today!!\"],\"AlphaPlay Games\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sP88l2x2y3yxHsD13tukhAUJklVu9t0sJZXqICGkmrSJ8zZK2LyIi3KUXwWBFBbsZmJE_AkcwcunS1qZHzpj37c\"],null,[232,186,172,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Implied Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gamebp.screw3d\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.gamebp.screw3d\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"C