LoCOwofChlwdXp6bGUubWVyZ2UuaG90ZWwuZW1waXJlEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"7GcAGVzgBRc\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:7GcAGVzgBRc?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:7GcAGVzgBRc\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznRFmIDnh6vbABJej3HOlF0bMAapOhtkFFi7iifRnase2phVoMInAmYAcflaTLPVJLOF5voNBZsffrboKXX2XXBMvdWQah1By9LOp1l4gmTBU9NTGBzU9N6Z_xkAQ04yUGXirrdbIpB18pLiSpfZNTJSk0IziGDznBeDScCWubCm4NyMqVlu0EwGKHDO4Q7Mqzmol9MVW0JcW_LRb2oX_DCeWRED8EGyKjfsON9pfxfpYDmys_OZGAtwIr7m7sy0cDjVUqtfJLJKaO-vqqjGzOfCXxbVV4pgeMgHNP-1ySYvQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7GcAGVzgBRc/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to a world where you can design, decorate, and merge your way to success! In this merge 2 game, you will help Elsa fulfill her lifelong ambition to design a world-class resort. If you love to decorate and enjoy the mechanics of a merge 2 game, you have found your perfect match. Dive into the ultimate design experience and show off your skills as you decorate every corner of the manor.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eElsa bought her dream house, but it is in terrible condition. The mansion requires a massive renovation, and she needs a partner who loves to design and decorate to save the day. Between a rival hotel owner trying to shut her down and a mysterious \\u0026quot;\\u0026quot;curse\\u0026quot;\\u0026quot; hanging over the city, Elsa has her work cut out for her.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExciting Game Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unique Merge 2 Game Play: Match and merge items to create powerful tools for your renovation.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Creative Design \\u0026amp; Decorate Tasks: Take full control of the interior design and turn a dusty manor into a luxury hotel.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Deep Storyline: Unravel the mystery of the \\u0026quot;\\u0026quot;curse of hoteliers\\u0026quot;\\u0026quot; and outsmart your competition.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Room Makeovers: Unlock and decorate various rooms, from cozy bedrooms to grand lobbies.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Relaxing Puzzles: Enjoy a stress-free experience as you merge objects and watch the hotel transform.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;My home needs help!\\u0026quot; Elsa thinks. Join her now to match and merge objects to create valuable tools. This merge 2 game offers a chance to relax and submerge yourself in the world of hospitality. If you enjoy home design and makeover challenges, you will love the story waiting for you here. Flip the story upside down, outsmart your competitors, and decorate room after room. Your design contribution matters!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://static.moonactive.net/legal/terms.html?lang\\u003den\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Notice: https://static.moonactive.net/legal/privacy.html?lang\\u003den\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eQuestions about the game? Our support is ready and waiting at: https://support.mergehotelempiregames.com/hc/en-us\"],\"Moon Active\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MwwTaFmWLB_j3e20l9BKXUwoSOc9T4Eh6SE6hNBlgWzvZgd1MgZgDE66_-j4eq6nrp1O0uAlwP9G6sZReN2eWtk\"],null,[112,72,60,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[