XLebATUTshGXQ7Uu2sHuSkl7x9IYb3DChlLw9NVTZH7A\"]]],\"Family Farm Seaside®\",[\"4.1\",4.13],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.funplus.familyfarm\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.funplus.familyfarm\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.funplus.familyfarm\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIKEoTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOAocChZjb20uZnVucGx1cy5mYW1pbHlmYXJtEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"AUtGGD6yOBw\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:AUtGGD6yOBw?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:AUtGGD6yOBw\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlQenI2CfKqe7M7Omx_PN7rLJw-_kYxSRy-JVW0eEk_CqBLBNZpvOjleOp8-jo1r2ioCZadmNcXos2jrlNnYYYu9ALk7WmH6OzOC4Nv26lPe1U9lkId_qyO2tIohJaeHIxK9AK8jWjDbLuRpmCz21kPxtgC8yU_I8VUaFTRrUJc9vnDELgS6QkJ3r2ogwXffVSP2tT-ljKEdNqYTEAwKTN1OWD3tMD_wUbYr880xmg4lLQ-xfPbzvwwNqg-NJv7Jnef1AH3g1JGkOKkTTW9Bc13Y7SEBea-4Co9Sd0VqvITBQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AUtGGD6yOBw/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Get Ready for the Holidays with Google Play’s Festive Updates\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBeautiful and fun farming simulation game. Raise cute farm animals and harvest diverse crops to make your farm a success! It\\u0026#39;s up to you to make your dream farm by the seaside. \\u003cb\\u003eStart building your dream farm now. \\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■■ Game Features ■■\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Played by over 60 million people all around the world!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Tired of upgrading the Barn? Enjoy unlimited Barn space.\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Prepare more than 600+ dishes in the kitchen. \\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Plant, harvest and produce over 300+ unique products!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Compete with other farmers in the new Farm Beauty Contest!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Daily orders and new missions added regularly for more fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ 500+ unique, cute, and well-designed decorations!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Adopt pets and costume them with pet apparel and equipment. Now you can breed pets to make new baby pets!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Exotic Island Farm: Explore a Mine, Garden! \\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Marine Sea Resort: You are now the owner of the Sea Resort! Complete resort orders and build the best resort for visitors to come to!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Visit neighbors\\u0026#39; farms and sample their newest dishes to earn prizes, help clean decorations, and trade for needed farm products!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFamily Farm Seaside supports 21 languages including; English, Arabic, Dutch, French, German, Indonesian, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian Bokmål, Persian, Polish, Portuguese, Russian, Spanish, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e※ Product Usage Details \\u003cbr\\u003e- Recommended Specifications: CPU Quad core 2.3GHz, Ram 2GB\\u003cbr\\u003e- Minimum Specifications: CPU Quad core 1.5GHz, Ram 1GB\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e※ Access permission notice for gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eSTORAGE: The permission is required to store game data and will not access personal files such as photos.\\u003cbr\\u003ePHONE: The permission is required to proceed with in-game events and rewards and will not affect calls.\\u003cbr\\u003eCONTACTS: The permission is required to sync your friend list and Google Account.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e※ App Notes\\u003cbr\\u003e- This app requires an active internet connection to play. Please make sure your device is connected while playing.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Family Farm Seaside is completely free to download and free to play. However, some items in the game can be purchased with real money. If you don\\u0026#39;t want to use this feature, please disable in-app purchases in your device\\u0026#39;s settings.\