toB207Mwx5oU0zUnj5WP-GnxtnVrtXrH3J8dTcCI4OL5G45viXLS\"]],[null,2,[2064,2752],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ua0knHIjusivcd4f5x0SePh_DK4bp-ywMunaxTDRkRNWKkAHSYRdHE0vVAwttGZdN9GLcDRTUuSfDhX40jCFiQ\"]]],\"Bluey: Let's Play!\",[\"4.1\",4.0666666],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.budgestudios.googleplay.BlueyBLU\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.budgestudios.googleplay.BlueyBLU\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.budgestudios.googleplay.BlueyBLU\"]],[\"qgJ+GnwILkoTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQAIgCAroCRgoqCiRjb20uYnVkZ2VzdHVkaW9zLmdvb2dsZXBsYXkuQmx1ZXlCTFUQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAHKAgQIAhAB\"],[[[null,null,\"Uc8LuvyBykc\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:Uc8LuvyBykc?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:Uc8LuvyBykc\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezknucj_5CALuTYiB7fxQzpsugVkjy69FYBauWp3z4XbFNf9t_hP9MMdzHH0SOnLsEEKr5faC9k62QHB3Yye4TDvLtStDrNQeXZ4q-tucskg2mL3G8obSEpH2h_CUDQ6mC58dRnlR3FQpiO5OmNCzgg4rBMfYRSs9Xx-iNcOIDLzaTrJ-vVVZ6ESIdWwtOu6UNkk9ccDyf3u2w9_W9OUW0Dp1p2BQ8PuM0f_DJNkzV_YbKsEWBbbGSQ2QnHgzz7c3SEKPj8Od97D0dBe5aV4VZVVZX89pmo12BSRQ79cpEmh3w\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Uc8LuvyBykc/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Explore, imagine, create \\u0026amp; play in Bluey\\u0026#39;s house. There\\u0026#39;s so much to do!\\u003cbr\\u003eWackadoo! Come join Bluey, her friends \\u0026amp; family! For real life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFun, easy \\u0026amp; calm kids learning game for boys and girls of all ages. Preschool children and toddlers will enjoy this app. Parents and other family members can play along too!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEXPLORE\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover and play all over the Heeler family home, just like in the TV show! Hunt for longdogs, play a game of Pop up Croc, listen to your favorite Bluey tunes, and so much more! Can you find all the hidden surprises?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIMAGINE\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery room allows for deep, imaginative play. Just like Bluey, anything is possible if you use your imagination! Make up your own stories as you go, or re-create your favorite Bluey moments. Bingo, Bandit, Chili, and all of Bluey’s friends and family are here and ready to join the fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCREATE\\u003cbr\\u003eBluey\\u0026#39;s house is your virtual playset and the fun is at your fingertips! Tap, drag and interact with everything. Cook up some favorite recipes in the kitchen, help build a pizza oven in the backyard or throw a tea party - there’s no end to what you can create! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePLAY\\u003cbr\\u003eHave a game of keepy-uppy, bounce on the trampoline, splash in a tub full of bubbles or swing in the backyard - the possibilities are endless! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCOLORING\\u003cbr\\u003eFun toddler coloring games and kids coloring pages. Color your favorite scenes and characters from the Bluey world. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSAFE \\u0026amp; KID FRIENDLY\\u003cbr\\u003eFun kids games designed for preschool, toddler, kindergarten, elementary school girls \\u0026amp; boys, based on their favorite show available on YouTube, YouTube Kids \\u0026amp; Disney+. This interactive Bluey game is easy and fun to play for children aged 2-9.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eABOUT BLUEY\\u003cbr\\u003eBluey is a loveable, inexhaustible six year-old Blue Heeler dog, who loves to turn everyday family life into boundless, playful adventures, developing her imagination and resilience as she goes. The award-winning TV show has been praised for its depiction of modern families and positive parenting.  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eABOUT BUDGE STUDIOS\\u003cbr\\u003eBudge Studios was founded in 2010 with the mission to entertain and educate toddler boys and girls around the world, through innovation, creativity and fun. Its high-quality app portfolio consists of original and branded properties, including Bluey, Disney Frozen, Barbie, PAW Patrol, Hot Wheels, Thomas \\u0026amp; Friends, Transformers, My Little Pony, Strawberry Shortcake, Miraculous, Caillou, The Smurfs, Miss Hollywood, Hello Kitty and Crayola. Budge Studios maintains the highest standards of safety and age-appropriateness, and has become a global leader in children’s apps for smartphones and tablets. Designed for all ages from a baby to toddler to elementary school aged, kids will enjoy these fun toddler games for 2,3,4,5,6,7 year olds. Budge Studios crafts fantastic, safe games where every toddler explores and learns with vibrant coloring activities. Parents trust our dedication to toddler safety and quality. Discover delightful toddler games filled with endless coloring fun for creative expression and engaging coloring. Where toddlers learn and grow through imaginative play, captivating coloring, cooking games, pretend play and more! For safe digital fun designed for your toddler, choose our educational coloring experiences!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA paid subscription is required to access some app content.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNeed Help?\\u003cbr\\u003eContact us at: support@budgestudios.ca\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBLUEY TM and BLUEY character logos TM \\u0026amp; © Ludo Studio Pty Ltd 2018. Licensed by BBC Studios. BBC logo TM \\u0026amp; © BBC 1996\\u003cbr\\u003eBUDGE and BUDGE STUDIOS are trademarks of Budge Studios Inc.\\u003cbr\\u003eBluey: Let\\u0026#39;s Play © 2025 Budge Studios Inc. All Rights Reserved.\"],\"Budge Studios\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"Ages up to 12\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5PJPD44SSQsx5XgWfw5fmO0yW6ecZ8Ha-7UKfcmo_ESAcQEtcIMJUY9rmd6FHcqk_j4VON865