7H0a0lz-i1PmGWwj6EuU1ln-qf94CZJyFG4qiz44Jq5TL2Vq0jVu7IBvYRw\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ee0Vkrzrdg6ogxcxwiLoiLEBK_0UzmUZ246oZRYmiXRR3DpcsP9osefblIhK1vknZfxfxDxaoSGmAmAm0uqGcFg\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ga0mJCtf_1ul62_xos5MEzRKGU3HEWaJDU7L5ALXIirNvAr9Gyd6j4eiS1wrcHu0zJ7VOavYLEmn5jv2N2laDQ\"]]],\"Big Farm: Mobile Harvest\",[\"4.0\",4.0307693],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.goodgamestudios.bigfarmmobileharvest\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.goodgamestudios.bigfarmmobileharvest\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.goodgamestudios.bigfarmmobileharvest\"]],[\"qgJ4GnYIMUoTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCSgouCihjb20uZ29vZGdhbWVzdHVkaW9zLmJpZ2Zhcm1tb2JpbGVoYXJ2ZXN0EAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"smF5Gn4y-CQ\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:smF5Gn4y-CQ?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:smF5Gn4y-CQ\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezm_6LjRLvXmXBGZH9PqFqr68FwUbXf_zULbIehYrtHvG2W182mTCkPFH6bBYlT-_RBFO3vEEJtAx7IQ5xt-zf0UDI7NHoiBdpyZO0onvwiZwmFCIGmvH6p-UWMqPDq17rb_DSqbMGIksHJpmOSzD5zG2CXScfA3-UQa1p80sHlIhPHQ_Zz7vzvxnKm4rrPt4OQYCZtG7QwKSmI2Hss-y1pZW-549XxoKr0aVsSGtKlfV0w22DgTWOuieVrQoOfe2w24TKWPIrFPD_Jebu8oPrIEsq5SNtj6G4XyCSXhCEdz-w\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/smF5Gn4y-CQ/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Big Farm: Mobile Harvest is a relaxing farm simulator you can play at your own pace - with friends, family, and a farming community that\\u0026#39;s always got your back. Build the farm life of your dreams, one peaceful season at a time. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eRelax on your farm:\\u003c/b\\u003e Escape the hustle and bustle of the city. No pressure, no rush — just you, your fields, and your animals. Pick it up for five minutes or five hours, whenever suits you. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFarming simulator experience:\\u003c/b\\u003e Plant, grow, and harvest your favorite fruits and vegetables. Manage your farm your way - every choice is yours.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCare for your animal friends:\\u003c/b\\u003e A good farmer keeps their four-legged friends happy. Have fun looking after cows, goats, chickens, horses, pigs, and plenty of other cuddly companions. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eTeam up with your farming family:\\u003c/b\\u003e Join a co-op with friends, family, or fellow farmers - help each other out, chat, and complete quests together. Some of our players farm with their spouse, their siblings, or friends they\\u0026#39;ve made right here in the game. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFarm, harvest, and trade:\\u003c/b\\u003e Got extra corn but need strawberries? Head to the market and make a deal to help your farming village prosper. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eBuild your dream farm:\\u003c/b\\u003e Add vintage buildings, windmills, and decorations to make your farm truly your own. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eGrow what you love:\\u003c/b\\u003e From tropical fruits to organic vegetables, choose what to plant and make your farm village your own. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFarming adventures:\\u003c/b\\u003e Take part in seasonal events and farming quests to earn rewards and discover new things for your farm. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eMore than a farming game - it\\u0026#39;s a community:\\u003c/b\\u003e Meet, chat, and grow together with a community of farmers who love this as much as you do. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBig Farm: Mobile Harvest is completely free to play with optional in-app purchases. You may disable in-app purchasing using your device settings. This game requires an internet connection. Privacy Policy, Terms \\u0026amp; Conditions, Imprint: https://policies.altigi.de/\"],\"Goodgame Studios\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/b-lNDSzTFDgoo0O4ZbpjcX8FDI5-0jZuEqBkGBkxDIm8JhCmQZzxfan2N-lVrSu2IZQyD2ZtfJi87Xdn7puG\"],null,[39,57,23,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.goodgamestudios.bigfarmmobileharvest\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.goodgamestudios.bigfarmmobileharvest\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.cat.hole.puzzle.aos\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DWcs-Dm1BFl5fq4Z-PO2GeNzDdAuKB4-Vb9BdYehJL6EEFuCRXB0av1ZDVllP0bG74FfmJ