03cbr\\u003eSpin the wheel of fortune to get coins and unlock magical sea creatures 🐠! Win rewards 🏆, catch fish 🐟, raid 🏴\\u200d☠️, loot treasure 💎, and attack your friends ⚔️ while you restore and build your island 🏝️ in this exciting fishing game. Enjoy this arcade fishing game with the Captain and his Pingo crew 🐧.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLooking for multiplayer fun? In Fish of Fortune, you can play solo or play with friends, raid and attack their island ⚔️ 🏝️ as you compete for fishing game glory and become the fishing master! Take a classic fishing game, give it a coin game twist, and add fun multiplayer mechanics. Raid your friends 🏴\\u200d☠️ and gather energy to build your dream island 🏝️!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eNot Your Average Fishing Game\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFish of Fortune is a unique fishing game 🐟 mixed with a thrilling island adventure 🏝️. Raid friends 🏴\\u200d☠️, loot treasure 💎, collect coins, and spin the wheel to unlock special rewards 🏆 in this one-of-a-kind fishing game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eSpin the Wheel of Fortune to Earn Loot!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpin the wheel to reveal your fortune! Will you land on attack time ⚔️, loot 💎, shields 🛡️, raid 🏴\\u200d☠️, puzzle 🧩, coins? The possibilities are endless! Earn coins to upgrade and build your island 🏝️ and advance through fish levels 🐟 in this thrilling fishing game. Earn shields 🛡️ to protect your island from other players trying to attack ⚔️. Become the fishing coin master 🏆 with the strongest island 🏝️ and the most loot in this epic fishing game adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eEarn Free Coins in Your Fishing Game!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect coins by spinning the wheel and use them to restore 🛠️, decorate, and build islands 🏝️. If you’re feeling lazy 😴—like a fish 🐟 out of water—you can use the autospin mode 🔄 to collect coins while you sit back and relax in your fishing game world! Attack and raid islands 🏝️ to steal loot 💎 and become the wealthiest fisherman in the game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eLet the Fishing Game Raid Games Commence!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpinning the wheel isn’t the only way to win! ⚔️ Attack friends, raid them 🏴\\u200d☠️, and loot their island 🏝️ to steal treasures 🏆 and coins in this competitive fishing game! Become the coin champion 🏆 of this exciting multiplayer fishing game adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003ePlay with Friends in This Epic Fishing Game!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the best fishing Captain, cute Pingos 🐧, and big fish 🐟 in this fun coin game! Spin the wheel to earn coins, raid your friend’s island, and build your fishing game island 🏝️ to be the strongest of all. Join our growing Fortune Fishers community 🐟 on Facebook to play together, meet new fish friends, earn big rewards 🏆 in this cool fishing game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCollect All the Fish Cards in This Fishing Game!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s not just about loot 💎, it’s also about collecting treasures 🏆! Spin the wheel to gather and upgrade dozens of fish cards featuring characters from Fish of Fortune 🐟 in this incredible fishing game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Fish of Fortune on Facebook for exclusive offers and bonuses in this fantastic fishing game!\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/FishOfFortune\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSomething fishy in the air? Having problems?\\u003cbr\\u003ePlease contact us in the game by clicking on the menu \\u0026gt; Settings \\u0026gt; Support or email us at support@whalo.com.\"],\"Whalo\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QAkSD8Wi3LA3WQZ9HJG_bPr-9PmV083h5Q5yEhbqPAv9VLTfw6v7fbwkJqB1P5Ufbna6avYCmDY5rAeBPvL4zA\"],null,[126,240,242,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalo.games.fishoffortune\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.whalo.games.fishoffortune\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.crowdstar.covetfashion\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/i2D9lPSfMUtwe_LSsevBpelo0twtty5ihw9KNUIDSKEkKyB1i7zgbLQpD3Rd4c4T5z5CrdpSYx_IQtR309tM0A\"],null,[119,77,57,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AuoU5JspRnrIe783L4K1X_Gw4my2hWB0-s1g5V14jg6o6O3HJUAn4ROkCv6EYJOvShRJCo-w9aTdxOKQnHGO\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PWR8du1ggYKJVLqOIAOL48cS2i9z0k4UzH9ot78iWpOeFaLIWOROW_k6N7B30talmZvvSm4NXY0czuoZvIC0Cw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MsqNv9AGk5NFmF1mM5gYzB-jYI_Kb5xq2dIsp4Dzh8hUfIWyHWQTNu8DTg2eoqhmB5LGkIcFAeqMc5hhb7t5PA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,nu