t Cafe : Coffee cat\",[],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.actionfit.catmerge\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.actionfit.catmerge\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.actionfit.catmerge\"]],[\"qgJgGl4IOEoTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMgocChZjb20uYWN0aW9uZml0LmNhdG1lcmdlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"OVzhPYi7Wk4\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:OVzhPYi7Wk4?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:OVzhPYi7Wk4\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmf8KRQKGV2KzUk-sVjtrrzFYmCZubK0Xwr9_JRpxLiLPgFVHmRzoWJsgg5QIr5gpomhGNnzRmDpRbqBLkpOhgtnJ_mM9ldvIqlCp4k-s5npk_J_RxgTMj3-UOw2ZYWUJqIPvTatfsFxElPDWsJ154RodccorvPkLjDVkQb8O0pdMGcbe2qh3_Yuhxp65e9SW7LbyOIeMLpDiFIbh5luZDI90-_MnfGRPVvqgloIEM6R6tZmvK45lNBHS3atBS3BclrKCHN6LK20y-FgWegoDUXBoN1FJ52KIDcaalhQZTANg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OVzhPYi7Wk4/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"🎉 Welcome to the Cat Cafe! The amazing cat cafe you\\u0026#39;ve been waiting for is finally open for business!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍳Merge various ingredients to create and sell bread and coffee, earn money, and operate an even more fantastic cafe! The more you enjoy the merge puzzle game, the more you can expand with even cooler and more glamorous buildings!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e☕️Popular Cafe Dishes:\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge hundreds of sweet and soft food items to create outstanding meals. Discovering new recipes allows you to explore dishes from around the world, from sweeter cakes to savory walnut pies! Our cat cafe prepares not only bread and coffee but also a variety of dishes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🐈Cute Cat Managers:\\u003cbr\\u003eHire popular managers, from cute maid cats to hip rapper cats, to increase the cafe\\u0026#39;s revenue. Unlock adorable and stylish cat managers to earn more money and expand your cafe even further!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥New Store Challenges:\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenge yourself not only with cafes but also with various areas such as ice cream shops, bookstores, flower shops, barbecue restaurants, and more! Expanding unique stores that utilize the strengths of your managers can earn you more money. Entrust the flower shop to a cat who loves flowers and trees. Increase the value of your own brand.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e🥪Merge - Combine various items to create mouthwatering dishes!\\u003cbr\\u003e🍪Serving - Serve the menu items that customers order.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁Collecting - Discover cute cat managers, your own recipes, unique items, and special treasures!\\u003cbr\\u003e🏝️Relaxation - Play the game comfortably anytime, anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐️Don\\u0026#39;t miss the chance to enjoy the healing cat cafe just by looking at it! You can only enjoy the delicious cafe cooking game with various cats in Cat Cafe Merge. Immerse yourself in the charming and enjoyable gameplay of Cat Cafe Merge!\"],\"ACTIONFIT Inc.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iQCFiSfmPxRHlXlsbMfYheS3DsccJaEKt3U5VBcAkbXzKItxtlTPEZtotGtp8aoIMOnaNhzM2TBDlKkNz82gMUM\"],null,[243,180,100,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"htt