0wpYHEjLgISn4lU5_TC0ZLbqMNY4N9GL24ZFVUIQxZ626hsP9VDCxckt3GkDnmXWOdIMowTr9sRMhatUJoDr4pjDYEVB34bxslhcfNyhm36F56M4yW0QZlLz4b3tRW2hINnQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vYhKBEuiNKU/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Create your avatar, make friends, and explore a cozy social world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to PLAY TOGETHER, a vibrant virtual world full of fun mini games and social activities.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Create a character that is uniquely you and make all kinds of friends.\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomize your character from head to toe in your unique style. The possibilities are endless with a variety of skin tones, hairstyles, body types, and costumes to choose from. Maybe, you\\u0026#39;ll find that special someone in your life as you chat with and befriend various people from around the world!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Turn your humble abode into the home of your dreams and invite friends over for a Home Party!\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose a house from a wide range of styles and concepts and a countless number of furniture pieces to make your dream home fantasy a reality right before your eyes. Invite friends over or visit their homes to catch fish, play games, chit-chat, and role-play together for hours of fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Have a blast playing fun-filled minigames with friends.\\u003cbr\\u003eDemonstrate your mad gaming skills in minigames such as Game Party, where the last one standing from 30 players wins, Zombie Virus, Obby Race, Tower of Infinity, Fashion Star Runway, Snowball Fight, Sky High, as well as an assortment of additional minigames found only in school.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Go around various fishing spots to catch new species of fish and show them off to others!\\u003cbr\\u003eCatch over 600 species of fish in places such as a pond, the sea, and even a swimming pool. It\\u0026#39;s never a dull moment as new fish to catch are constantly added to the game. Every fishing spot has fish not found in other spots, so visit them all to complete the collections listed in the Illustrated Book and show people what you\\u0026#39;ve caught!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Catch insects and lizards with your friends in various locations or go excavate rare ores and fossils.\\u003cbr\\u003eOver 300 species of insects are thriving throughout the in-game world! Also, look forward to a unique and fun experience digging up dinosaur fossils and rare diamonds. Sell your findings directly or show off your accomplishments to your friends by beautifully displaying them for double the satisfaction.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Please Note]\\u003cbr\\u003e* Although Play Together is free, the game contains optional in-app purchases that may incur additional charges. Please note that refund of in-app purchases may be restricted depending on circumstance.\\u003cbr\\u003e* For our usage policy (including policy on refunds \\u0026amp; termination of service), please read the Terms of Service listed in the game.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Indonesia Game Rating (IGRS): 13+ (Classification No. IGRS-LN-202602-V-00552-03160)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e※ Use of illegal programs, modified apps, and other unauthorized methods to access the game may result in service restrictions, removal of game accounts and data, claims for compensation of damages, and other remedies deemed necessary under the Terms of Service.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Official Community]\\u003cbr\\u003e- Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/PlayTogetherGame/\\u003cbr\\u003e* For game-related queries:support@playtogether.zendesk.com\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e▶About App Access Permissions◀\\u003cbr\\u003eIn order to provide you with game services listed below, the app will ask you for permission to grant access as follows.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Required Permissions]\\u003cbr\\u003eAccess to Files/Media/Photos: This allows the game to save data on your device, and to store any gameplay footage or screenshots you take within the game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[How to Revoke Permissions]\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ Android 6.0 and above: Device Settings \\u0026gt; Apps \\u0026gt; select app \\u0026gt; App Permissions \\u0026gt; grant or revoke permission\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ Below Android 6.0: Upgrade your OS version to revoke the access permissions as above, or delete the app\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e※ You can revoke your permission for the app to access game files from your device by following the instructions above.\\u003cbr\\u003e※ If you are using a device which runs below Android 6.0, you will not be able to set permissions manually, so we recommend that you upgrade your OS to Android 6.0 or higher.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Caution]\\u003cbr\\u003eRevoking the required access permissions may prevent you from accessing the game and/or cause termination of game resources that are running on your device.\"],\"HAEGIN Co., Ltd.\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aHOH66Rr-3cArx3jxJb9wfaRs2ANtPNJtP6fxAOphE8GNAcmtJtl6v8Mz91a5_8c9ppVQj2OtDYzsJkumx2SXzI\"],null,[187,200,53,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dc