rpy Sort, a delightful sorting game filled with soft colors, cozy sounds, and cheerful little birds.\\u003cbr\\u003e No rush, no stress — just gentle sorting and the joy of calm organization.\\u003cbr\\u003eHelp your tiny bird friends find their matching companions and watch them flutter, settle, and chirp with happiness.\\u003cbr\\u003e Each sound and motion brings a wave of peace — it’s oddly satisfying and endlessly relaxing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures\\u003cbr\\u003e- Soothing ASMR sounds and gentle bird chirps\\u003cbr\\u003e- Cute, expressive birds that respond to your touch\\u003cbr\\u003e- Bright, heartwarming scenes full of color and charm\\u003cbr\\u003e- Simple one-finger controls — easy to play, easy to love\\u003cbr\\u003e- A satisfying sense of order for organizing lovers\\u003cbr\\u003e- No timers, no limits — play at your own cozy pace\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake a deep breath, sort a few birds, and feel the calm.\\u003cbr\\u003eChirpy Sort — your daily pocket of soft joy.\"],\"AIM TOP GAME TECHNOLOGY LIMITED - Bird\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hW0j25uuTB__stljm-cK7TO5Viy8YHi81_oBJIt8SWz5sLU8M9rFNUjJeyCX-hM8fwoh-DtzeKI5KJWcEtpSIg\"],null,[55,49,27,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003da