Q\"]],[null,2,[1280,2028],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fxfAP12v11q9MxQoDWYOzjOvBODh3PSUuiQgUrmF65HEuhGcTmU235iW0FbVSGWacvRVfXvgh9cp5QA0jraz8LQ\"]]],\"Candy Crush Friends Saga\",[\"4.5\",4.46],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.candycrush4\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.king.candycrush4\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.candycrush4\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIR0oTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgoaChRjb20ua2luZy5jYW5keWNydXNoNBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"bYYFHCmPVRs\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:bYYFHCmPVRs?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:bYYFHCmPVRs\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmvx-upN-rr_vStXLzbLA6wIPAywIr71jOi3kCvi8aSObim2Ox-1XMm9CGuNTEk0abKngSqVD3W7WQmODKiVcH8uz-keAfXtX0OJKhQ8WI-HWhP23b2CtXMMbp6GV30F5RzvPZV683Fu_wTCYdJAp1wPm_mvlzhOCqYatg0EG-8KBwLVlgn-bfW_KsdMG75YFlOD9yh_6mqKIOjoByS9MrHhzmOI-V-roYAF3I90wq5eMhUHHqQodAZi4WkxidrU6QKAvQ5c1hAtwV29e8qJQfhlsCeLFWmYQnkw2wFSwwFbw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bYYFHCmPVRs/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"With updated graphics, fun game modes and a host of friends to help you blast through hundreds of levels!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYour Candy Crush Friends have been scattered throughout the Candy Kingdom - Join this match 3 puzzle game to find them! This friendly bunch have their own unique powers to help you to create sweet candy combinations and blast through blockers!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSwitch and match candies to unlock rewards, friends, and sweet collectable outfits! The more candies you collect the greater your power on the game board!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis fun new Candy Crush puzzle game is filled with delicious treats - cookies, jam, chocolate and more! Your favourite game modes, but sweeter than ever!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCandy Crush Friends Saga features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍬 HUNDREDS OF MATCH 3 LEVELS TO PLAY – COLLECT FRIENDS ALONG THE WAY!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKeep your new friends in a sticker book and change their outfits!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍭 YOUR CANDY CRUSH FRIENDS ARE YOUR ALLIES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMeet Yeti, Tiffy, Misty or Nutcracker... they are ready to help you blast through levels!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍬 FUN NEW GAME MODES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDunk the cookie in the chocolate \\u0026amp; free the octopuses and the mammoths!  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWatch Yeti and his friends dance when you win levels!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍭 EXPLORE SWEET NEW WORLDS IN 3D\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍬 EASY TO PLAY BUT CHALLENGING TO MASTER\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake on this epic saga alone or play with friends to see who can get the highest score!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEasily sync the game between devices and access full game features when connected to the internet\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCandy Crush Friends Saga is free to play but optional in-game items require payment. You can turn off the payment feature by disabling in-app purchases in your device’s settings.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBy downloading this game you are agreeing to our terms of service which can be found at https://king.com/termsAndConditions\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you need help and support, you will find helpful and extensive FAQs in our in-game Help Center, click the ‘?’ to launch it.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eShare opinions and have sweet discussions with other members of the Candy Crush Friends Saga community. https://community.king.com/en/candy-crush-friends-saga/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit www.candycrushfriendssaga.com and discover delicious game guides and tasty blogs to satisfy your candy cravings.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook @CandyCrushFriendsSaga\\u003cbr\\u003eTwitter @CandyFriends\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram @CandyCrushSaga\\u003cbr\\u003eYouTube @CandyCrushOfficial\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo not sell my data: King shares your personal information with advertising partners to personalize ads. Learn more at https://king.com/privacyPolicy.  If you wish to exercise your Do Not Sell My Data rights, you can do so by contacting us via the in game help centre or by going to https://soporto.king.com/\"],\"King\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dAPpO5iOIUwc-XQ8Qdy8bBoMfMu76KBgQFzi9TRSOgKIY5j5kdnhLiyNIcIA8hapHJ-hemq_yLOaQhE2CNet\"],null,[42,125,182,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.candycrush4\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.king.candycrush4\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null