layer/yt:movie:tHG7JxRBto8?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:tHG7JxRBto8\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmdgL7jXrCyTNNK72POH2QOA0ePhW6dic5gc6pmSvWHKMuN86NAVzwlubH98J2gBbxwjW-Gh-ZVQ0bxVdcItO_LguQ05dy1bZo7tX8_G_ccxUQej47Ab2dtLHwYJzVnjCX39STbETrVcdGv3J3U7yLRLED4BVwI9C_21I3iZJRImyUaeCHdkHpGjnqou-gHy5XPQ4QF1zHYT8DdufcoHv4hN4q9TL1JVe4TnWrdagXBC6UspeU6VRw3Q84NOkeU8RqJKyc-wGjozYXiKNhYgz8ZxOy0tkPXsTNlKJeh-4bn6w\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tHG7JxRBto8/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Experience the road to Hollywood.\\u003cbr\\u003eIn Hollywood Crush, match 3 to dress up and live out your red-carpet dream!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAs a young, rising star playing small roles and working as an extra, your journey in Hollywood has been challenging. But life is like a box of chocolates, you never know what you\\u0026#39;re going to get. Along with the news of the famous star Peter\\u0026#39;s passing, there is also the revelation of an undisclosed daughter, who happens to be you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom this moment on, your life takes a whirlwind of transformation. Alongside navigating the ever-watchful eyes of the media, you must also be on guard against the obstacles posed by your half-sister Rose, who you share a father with.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Easy to play, match 3 to beat addictive levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Customize outfits for any occasion.\\u003cbr\\u003e■ 1,000s of outfits to choose from, including exclusive high-end dresses to stand out from the crowd.\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Simulate the drama of being a star and face all challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Romantic Hollywood encounters: choose a handsome partner.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to start your Hollywood journey?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e▼Facebook▼\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/en.HollywoodCrush\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e▼Facebook Email▼\\u003cbr\\u003esupport.hollywood@matchrella.com\"],\"VoyagerOne IE\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZMzej88fVSqJ3TFxYuQTj2Jb3qCoY92Tr6MXaGCN0ik92Udvp6sWS1V0jxTjEx2J5Go0Gm7ByW9WgAnNabMVTaw\"],null,[246,238,230,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.match.hollywood\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.match.hollywood\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.babystone.heroheroclicker\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/B7ypWCBeUHfeVlMiM1KrZ5KfKHhSkPbqVtchqqEL1IjfZDah3310UwV-1_HcleVCZ3bLWaKndxIfGejj9drB\"],null,[127,203,236,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[3840,2160],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/f2Bs1Q7tEc_BpWJtAE1llyqfX5Mkfuht4vUTRnjuWaMKGrIAGBBiGDBuVkR1nlKcW5LFxRDF0eEh7OFulbGnbA\"]],[null,2,[3840,2160],[null,null,\"h