play\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:d-6qZrQv2vI\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmnxNHTeyOvo_ncDvrjBNOJXQRNp9cRpxBOPzSYaPD8MCkH8kY4Id4l_Fg0xHzy8jSBO41rG6ocPG5UAioy1UBG--xqSLd0EqooAg9Z5S98rtP3_ng3mWTBTLeMy98Gn5QA3yswGWaX33-WSGsUqt2khnWlPuHoZdc7TgPiHnTy_RRa8pvaP3RZpK6KjOWLtuXMaYZLFMnUzYhqWfxFhLE9FyVtn3tRh35nPNdyDtJaBpXHhLCPUJVM2ftxUlopu5dv-XJ9_JHta63gqc8GNgffZrf__79MXKJBFOyqp510pQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/d-6qZrQv2vI/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Become the trendsetter in a modern world of fashion influencers. 👑 Compete with other players across the globe and show them your taste in this glamorous dress-up game! 👗\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Do you like stylish clothing? 👠\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Do you get excited about extravagant accessories or stunningly beautiful makeup and hair combinations? 💄\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThen you\\u0026#39;re in for a fashionable treat! Go on a shopping spree and expand your wardrobe with exquisite clothing and luxurious bags, hats, shoes, and jewelry. 🛍️ Choose the hairstyle and makeup, mix and match from millions of different clothing combinations, and find the perfect look for your avatar! 💃\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePocket Styler is a fun and engaging fashion game that lets you design your own unique looks and styles. Players can experiment with a wide range of clothing and accessories, mix and match different pieces, and create personalized outfits that showcase their sense of fashion. With an intuitive and user-friendly interface, Pocket Styler is easy to pick up and play, and is perfect for anyone who loves fashion, styling, and creativity. Whether you\\u0026#39;re a seasoned fashionista or just looking to try something new, Pocket Styler is the ultimate virtual fashion playground! 😎\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis dress-up fashion game features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👗 An ever-expanding collection of beautiful clothes and stylish accessories\\u003cbr\\u003e💄 A vast selection of makeup and hairstyles\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Numerous fashion events to participate in where you can win exclusive rewards\\u003cbr\\u003e😍 Roasting or praising other players\\u0026#39; looks\\u003cbr\\u003e👑 The chance to become a trendsetter and set the new rules of the game\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart your exciting dress-up adventure and join the glamorous world of fashion!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow us for new updates, contests, and more!\\u003cbr\\u003e👍 On Facebook\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/PocketStylerGame\\u003cbr\\u003e📸 On Instagram\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.instagram.com/pocketstylergame/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHaving trouble with the game? Got questions or ideas? 🤔\\u003cbr\\u003e💌 Contact us here! \\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.nordcurrent.com/support/?gameid\\u003d17\\u003cbr\\u003e📒 Privacy / Terms \\u0026amp; Conditions\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.nordcurrent.com/privacy/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAge rating in Indonesia - 3+ IGRS\"],\"Nordcurrent Games\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/USPvevbpXAv7428W7iFfBZXB6plbrq9yJfcuQixnbaoJg027Y7BYK9XvCvPYQlKwbX1pEm0-deOevM9xRt-eCg\"],null,[222,188,202,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,nu