Goods Master 3D:Matching Games\",[\"4.1\",4.142857],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.goods.master3d.triple.puzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.goods.master3d.triple.puzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.goods.master3d.triple.puzzle\"]],[\"qgJwGm4ITkoTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQgomCiBjb20uZ29vZHMubWFzdGVyM2QudHJpcGxlLnB1enpsZRABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Do you enjoy shopping at supermarkets and organizing your fridge? \\u003cbr\\u003eThen the triple matching game of Goods Master 3D is sure to provide you with a better experience! \\u003cbr\\u003eIn puzzle games, you can categorize snacks, drinks, and fruits and explore the fun of triple matching in 3D cupboards, unlocking more of your favorite products like the most matching games. \\u003cbr\\u003eThe puzzle games are straightforward, just drag the same 3D products to several shelves for pairing or triple matching.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨Game Features✨\\u003cbr\\u003eOver 1000 levels\\u003cbr\\u003eHyper-realistic 3D items: fries, snacks, 🍭 drinks, coconut slices🍪, soda🍪, etc.\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple matching games gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eGenerous rewards of props and coins\\u003cbr\\u003eRealistic scene changes\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy-to-play time-killing game\\u003cbr\\u003eSuper boosters and hints to help you pass difficult levels\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose realistic scenes and refrigerators to add fun to the game\\u003cbr\\u003eDetailed and beautiful design, choose your favorite realistic scenes\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e✨How to play✨\\u003cbr\\u003eClick on the same 3D items to add them to the shopping cart in puzzle games.\\u003cbr\\u003e3 identical items will be cleared.\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy robust features such as fun matching 3D games and collecting skill cards.\\u003cbr\\u003eYou can earn higher scores by cleaning and organizing the shelves in matching games.\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock more of your favorite products by completing more game levels.\\u003cbr\\u003eVarious products, as well as the ability to pass the time offline.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;Goods Master 3D\\u0026quot; also offers many unexpected surprises, and you can challenge your vision and concentration through matching sorting games. If you are a fan of matching games, why not give Goods Master 3D a try?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;Goods Master 3D\\u0026quot; is a classic casual matching game that combines elements of sorting, matching, and triple matching gameplay. In puzzle games, players need to sort various items to complete the task and challenge, while also using their observation and judgment skills to quickly and accurately match different types of goods. By matching three or more identical items, players can earn points and rewards, and continuously improve their rank and level.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe believe you all like match games, triple match games, and sorting games. And that\\u0026#39;s why \\u0026quot;Goods Master 3D\\u0026quot; features a variety of gameplay modes, including sorting goods and match goods. You must use your skills and strategy to match similar items and place them in the correct fridges or closets, while also trying to achieve Triple Match combos for even higher scores.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn addition to sorting and matching gameplay, \\u0026quot;Goods Master 3D\\u0026quot; also incorporates elements of color sorting. Players need to organize the items by category and color sort to fill the fridge or closet as efficiently as possible. The puzzle game\\u0026#39;s graphics are simple and beautiful, and the sound effects are pleasant, making it suitable for matching games players of all ages who enjoy Match games for adults or organizing games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover the ultimate tile matching adventure with \\u0026#39;Goods Master 3D,\\u0026#39; the fun games that sharpens your mind with challenging match 3 games and brain games. Dive into a world of mystery games without the need for wifi, where you can sort tiles, color balls, and same block in this free game for adults. \\u0026#39;Goods Master 3D\\u0026#39; is not just a simple adult game, the magic no wifi matching games full of intriguing puzzles that promises endless entertainment for those who love free games for adults.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBecome a sorting games master with \\u0026quot;Goods Master 3D\\u0026quot; - a vivid fusion of puzzle games, matching games \\u0026amp; organization games, which you can enjoy offline! Fine-tune your skills in the fun games that marries matching 3D and color match for an immersive puzzle games experience. Whether sorting colored balls or organizing goods in closet, puzzle games transform you into a goods match 3D leader. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSo why wait? Start playing \\u0026quot;Goods Master 3D\\u0026quot; today and see if you have what it takes to become a master of matching games!\"],\"Cobby Labs\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rp2AKSBrNjkeeVKoAh594t2lwnFdzALz5TeheNG4XYlcXpclXTjNF9nVH9ywCF2Pno8G1CHiAznRtOJl5XH0\"],null,[240,184,136,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0