,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.wemademax.projectsc\"]],[\"qgJnGmUIT0oTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOQodChdjb20ud2VtYWRlbWF4LnByb2plY3RzYxABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Humans have invaded hell.\\u003cbr\\u003eNow it is time for the demon heroes to strike back.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHellsquad Rrrush! is a casual roguelike tower defense game where cute demon heroes, smart builds, and thrilling RNG come together.\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery run feels different. Every choice shapes your battle. Your strategy decides your victory.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Cute demon heroes. Ruthless charges.\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your squad with charming but deadly demon heroes.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect, upgrade, and assemble the right lineup to unleash hellish power on every wave.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Roguelike strategy defense with real decision-making\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is not just a passive defense game.\\u003cbr\\u003ePick upgrades, adapt to random choices, and create powerful combinations on the fly in fast-paced tower defense battles.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ RNG, tactics, and endless replay value\\u003cbr\\u003eWill fate hand you the perfect build, or will you outplay the odds?\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy the rush of unpredictable combat with a strategy defense system that rewards smart planning.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ More than a tower defense game\\u003cbr\\u003eTake on Adventure Dungeon, Arena, Reclamation, and Guild Wars.\\u003cbr\\u003ePush through new chapters, clear tougher stages, and earn endless rewards as your demon heroes grow stronger.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Easy to start, satisfying to master\\u003cbr\\u003eJump in for quick casual sessions or stay for deeper progression.\\u003cbr\\u003eNew demon heroes and fresh content are added regularly, so there is always another battle, another reward, and another victory to chase.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ A world where demon heroes lead the charge\\u003cbr\\u003eLead the legions of hell, gather scattered demon heroes, and defend your world from human invaders.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe fate of hell is in your hands.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCute demon heroes, endless battles, endless rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003eOnce you start, you won\\u0026#39;t stop.\\u003cbr\\u003eIt is time to rush into battle with Hellsquad Rrrush!\"],\"Wemade Max Co., Ltd.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ilgE-rb55xY_FUm25En-lp_oE0u_lyr3eDqlRnam1KQtgELEPxg3ECkN8RFosJYOJBARfaoI_Xuw9A7Ihq5y\"],null,[129,13,204,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.wemademax.projectsc\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.wemademax.projectsc\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,nul