MdrSfM7EXH6XH_q7GfYFcyXOCovKyJmhl4iaA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gh9U_uyo7ueZdA_TJDKK5e3wgrh7AnKFWFSp3NOS5u6bqA6-_pQo4Z-5N-deGGWVmezs5d6u15aLsRgyky2J\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2OF0K8lI7FXsG4brZdzVLRl93V6IKLjjuzFz-P0vKuxazeeaw0k96o8JFWqKXQzpTWlynRmEsNS_s9rMyL5lTA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-W36B_1LIShcIfPKn9VMrAMjAxHZbKYZmRls79aSQMSh38PxdPB-k9F3Jnk21kynJ2N4NqMujGHTk6FtHQSx\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Pa07D-gWqWfj5gF4CSSAo6ak3VyE9oT7nqlMSvTUt5eq-8zvTyiGYRsE9Nup-bGlBS2Os-le7BhecGhlpfDd5TA\"]]],\"Black Hole - Eat Everything\",[\"3.6\",3.642857],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.hole.black.eat.relax.match3d.puzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.hole.black.eat.relax.match3d.puzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.hole.black.eat.relax.match3d.puzzle\"]],[\"qgJ3GnUIUEoTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCSQotCidjb20uaG9sZS5ibGFjay5lYXQucmVsYXgubWF0Y2gzZC5wdXp6bGUQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Get ready to swallow everything in sight!\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Black Hole - Eat Everything, a super fun and relaxing black hole game inspired by classic io games and the most popular eating games. Control a mysterious blackhole, swallow fruits, snacks, and giant desserts, and grow bigger with every bite. It’s one of the most satisfying games you’ll ever play — part puzzle, part collecting adventure, and all fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e🌀Start Small, Grow Big, Swallow All\\u003cbr\\u003eYour journey begins with a tiny hole. Start by swallowing small fruit like strawberries, apples, and watermelons. As your hole grows, you’ll take down burgers, donuts, pizzas, and even giant cakes. But this isn’t just about eating everything — it’s about clever moves and puzzle-solving strategy.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 How to Become the Ultimate Eating Champion:\\u003cbr\\u003eFind \\u0026amp; Swallow: Move your hole to swallow everything in sight — from apples and avocados to sweet donuts and cupcakes.\\u003cbr\\u003eControl the Black Hole: Watch as objects drop into your blackhole, giving you that perfect antistress and satisfying feeling.\\u003cbr\\u003eClear the Plate: Devour all the required items to complete each level and unlock more challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve Puzzles: Plan your path carefully to navigate tricky layouts and fill every space.\\u003cbr\\u003eRelax or Challenge: Play casually for stress relief, or take on tougher levels to prove your skill.\\u003cbr\\u003e🍩 A Delicious World to Explore\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery level is bursting with colorful snacks and playful puzzles. Roll through piles of fruit, collect cupcakes, and glide past obstacles as you grow your hole bigger and bigger. If you love color hole mechanics, collecting games, or puzzle games for free, this is the perfect game for you.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Why Players Love This Game:\\u003cbr\\u003eSuper smooth and satisfying gameplay that’s perfect for relaxation.\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to play, but filled with fun puzzles for free.\\u003cbr\\u003eA mix of digging games, eating games, and collecting games.\\u003cbr\\u003eThousands of creative levels with snacks, fruit, donuts, and cakes.\\u003cbr\\u003eInspired by donut county, holedown, and whole.io — beloved classics of io free games.\\u003cbr\\u003eNo pressure, just the joy of watching everything get swallowed by your hole!\\u003cbr\\u003e🕳️ Grow, Eat, and Conquer\\u003cbr\\u003eWith each level, your hole becomes more powerful. From tiny treats to massive feasts, nothing can escape the pull of your blackhole. Use your brain to solve puzzles, find clever angles, and swallow everything to clear the board. Whether you call it a blak hole, a donut hole, or just the ultimate void — the thrill of eating games has never been so fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e🍰 From juicy fruit to giant cakes, every bite brings you closer to becoming the ultimate champion. Glide through obstacles, collect every piece, fill in the gaps, and grow until nothing is left on the board. This is your world now — one delicious snack at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Download Black Hole - Eat Everything now\\u003cbr\\u003eJump into a colorful, playful, and deeply satisfying world. Whether you’re looking for a relaxing antistress escape or a puzzle challenge, this black hole game is for you. Swallow, collect, grow, and become the ultimate hole master!\"],\"Leapjoy Games Limited\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WIQFVVYBipXRFy1Bd2ssaSkipMzScVRIANf6xg_NyNPkK_-tXlpPo-tgOh97fkha-8jq6aQHxGnKyMIu64lvaQo\"],null,[253,213,223,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.hole.black.eat.relax.match3d.puzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.hole.black.eat.relax.match3d.puzzle\\u0026feature\\u0