ssupersaga\"]],[\"qgJsGmoIUkoTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPgoiChxjb20ua2luZy5mYXJtaGVyb2Vzc3VwZXJzYWdhEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"re6NlZb7_50\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:re6NlZb7_50?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:re6NlZb7_50\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznG_zhEMW4nmVT0vkjcaFpa2Ome8xAZ9GOLWqo47gvgalB-vF97wTNmywzvLCTSiy9IzooDr6--5UZ8iKHlAHgM0UIYluY85jweFji86XU_OdTsrW97A9cHMEYg_Wsrqi6eiYzamO-6vzX_yWccaIgUyAt8EasoxS4PUan8dN1AXi0A1UGLlgeQm-PFtXXUdBmMaKX9gOFVl5NtdR6cX4a02egOQ1S22y7CEB2IqtRiQtgaqoMc89b8FovV8gfo-qEbJ8KV6NAk7YoOCvkjKMWB48Tk0VQ4hrqHADyhL8ahug\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/re6NlZb7_50/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"The makers of Candy Crush Saga and Farm Heroes Saga are back with even bigger Cropsies and more switcher fun in Farm Heroes Super Saga! Help the Farm Heroes defeat Rancid and win the Country Show in this adorable match 3 adventure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Farm Heroes know Rancid Raccoon is up to his old tricks again and it\\u0026#39;s up to you to help them defeat him in this puzzle quest.  Grow and harvest the biggest Super Cropsies and stop Rancid from ruining the fun for everyone!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAdventure through this Farmtastic puzzle game while collecting as many Cropsies as you can! Help Fidget the squirrel collect his nuts, harvest adorable Super Cropsies and go on a puzzle quest to meet exciting new Farm Heroes. Be careful on your adventure and watch for Rancid Raccoon, he will pop up and try to stop you when you least expect him...\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFarm Heroes Super Saga features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMatch 3 Games - Easy to Play, Challenging to Master\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fun game with Farmtastic puzzles with new game modes \\u003cbr\\u003e• Match 3 games with hundreds of levels for hours of fun! \\u003cbr\\u003e• More fruit and veg to harvest; grow the biggest Cropsies and will the Country Show\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFarming Fun – Switch, Connect \\u0026amp; More\\u003cbr\\u003e• Switcher gameplay – Match 4 fruit or veg to grow Super Cropsies!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eConnect to Online Leaderboards\\u003cbr\\u003e• Connecting online through Facebook lets you compare scores with friends on the leaderboards and save your farm adventure on mobile and tablet devices\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Connect to the internet to unlock the full game features and keep collecting Cropsies\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake on this Croptastic Saga and help the Farm Heroes bring harmony back to rural farm life in this fun match 3 puzzle game! Defeat Rancid Raccoon’s sneaky plan and grow Super Cropsies!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload today and start collecting Cropsies!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit https://care.king.com/ if you need help!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow us to get news and updates:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/FarmHeroesSuperSaga/\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://twitter.com/farmheroessuper\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.youtube.com/user/FarmHeroesOfficial\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.instagram.com/farmheroessuper/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFarm Heroes Super Saga is completely free to play, but some optional in-game items will require payment. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo not sell my data: King shares your personal information with advertising partners to personalize ads. Learn more at https://king.com/privacyPolicy.  If you wish to exercise your Do Not Sell My Data rights, you can do so by contacting us via the in game help centre or by going to https://soporto.king.com/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBy downloading this game, you are agreeing to our terms of service: http://about.king.com/consumer-terms/terms\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHave fun playing Farm Heroes Super Saga!\"],\"King\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\