l,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.wannaplay.giantcrush\"]],[\"qgJoGmYIVEoTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOgoeChhjb20ud2FubmFwbGF5LmdpYW50Y3J1c2gQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"💥 SMASH GIANT MONSTERS!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to smash, crush, and destroy? Jump into Kick Monster, a fun action game packed with giant monsters, crazy weapons, satisfying destruction, and epic battles!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake a break, grab your favorite weapon, and unleash the chaos. Hunt down huge monsters, smash them to pieces, earn rewards, and upgrade your arsenal as you become stronger with every battle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🦖 BATTLE GIANT MONSTERS\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFace massive monsters and powerful bosses standing in your way. Run into battle, attack their weak spots, and keep smashing until every giant goes down.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach monster brings a new challenge. Hit hard, choose your weapons, and enjoy satisfying monster destruction as you fight your way through action-packed levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔨 UNLOCK CRAZY WEAPONS\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy fight monsters with ordinary weapons?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild an arsenal packed with hilarious and powerful ways to smash your enemies. Use hammers, flamethrowers, guns, rockets, and even ridiculous weapons you would never expect.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock new weapons, experiment with different attacks, and discover your favorite way to destroy every giant.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💣 SMASH, CRUSH \\u0026amp; DESTROY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSometimes you just want to break something.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKick Monster delivers simple, satisfying destruction whenever you need a quick break. Smash monsters, watch them fall apart, and unleash your weapons in fun battles designed for instant action.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeeling bored? Need to let off some steam? Pick a monster and start smashing!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚔️ BECOME A MONSTER HUNTER\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe monsters keep getting bigger, but so does your arsenal.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEarn coins after every victory, unlock upgrades, increase your power, and prepare for tougher giant battles. The stronger you become, the more satisfying the destruction gets.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 FUN \\u0026amp; EASY ACTION\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJump straight into battle with simple controls and fast gameplay. No complicated rules - just choose your weapon, attack the monster, and enjoy the destruction.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you have a few minutes or want to keep smashing boss after boss, there is always another giant waiting for you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 WHY YOU’LL LOVE KICK MONSTER\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Smash and destroy giant monsters\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fight huge bosses in action-packed battles\\u003cbr\\u003e• Unlock powerful and funny weapons\\u003cbr\\u003e• Upgrade your arsenal and become stronger\\u003cbr\\u003e• Enjoy satisfying destruction and crazy attacks\\u003cbr\\u003e• Discover new monsters and locations\\u003cbr\\u003e• Play quick, fun action levels\\u003cbr\\u003e• Let off some steam with monster-smashing gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe giants are waiting.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGrab your weapons, enter the battle, and show every monster who is stronger.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 Download Kick Monster and start smashing giants today!\"],\"Pixeland OU\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VmIcCMijm2Hq5KWvCVsqnbGEP22nfNUn39VuV3fsp0fUvi3Ypc9i7t0PPSpmHG8dsZHxOF0vVoc2DoC0prWAWA\"],null,[44,222,239,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9