Id\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.linecorp.LGGRTHN\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIXEoTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgoaChRjb20ubGluZWNvcnAuTEdHUlRIThABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"yFQx--VHVnI\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:yFQx--VHVnI?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:yFQx--VHVnI\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmOy5iiVlGldHw3Uuzaa43K-IO7HGT3x2Jx1Egr7fzefBSw_LwfR2PFtDNxVaJHJCEB98UnbeVQWeIy7jbpSwB1fKV3U2EHKn05mAdy91RDQmuFxCuNeJ6FRDP01gX-UqoTaN-4FNnaeDEah-eBZPkw4t8vfxbHmM-UCNnbMYY3lrQNczD4xF65nf0iUKXb_gKckmfVCEFyKBN_Arp1UmDrc3pnytsjKjpPgbLvGdXsdX27BauFvJ8Sf_zBCgf8Bg5CxH6TMtGKUCm4Fvr7IN18VjnM8MQLwmXEQjoBB-tK4Q\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yFQx--VHVnI/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Embark on a Global Adventure with Just Your Fingertips!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRoll the dice and set off on an epic journey across the world, where every move can change your destiny. Will you outsmart your rivals and emerge as the last one standing, crowned the ultimate millionaire?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenge friends and claim victory beyond the board!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn LINE Let’s Get Rich, it’s not just about luck; strategic thinking and sharp wit are the keys to victory. Invite your friends and family, turn the tables, and show them who truly rules the game! Whether you’re bankrupting cities, building landmarks, or unleashing special moves to flip the game, the excitement never stops!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover even more fun with the brand-new UFO map, the all-new Mini-Game System, and the Premium Pass, packed with exclusive rewards and exciting benefits. Special events and plenty of rewards are waiting for you!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to roll the dice and claim your for