\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dkr.co.alohacorp.ipmerge\"]],[\"qgJnGmUIXUoTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOQodChdrci5jby5hbG9oYWNvcnAuaXBtZXJnZRABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"37d3SrJKgCM\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:37d3SrJKgCM?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:37d3SrJKgCM\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkBcy0dOGq3L6tkCZGtEy-nMcEpzJR0UjVmDPGyYObtGU5EiSJSRoQ_RNOHSUvq3gaqM_ohTeNSaLWV74O2JokS_iSV-VktcIYbo-h178QKnpqT2fHAuUaI4_04TTBJF5zrzWxWvRZq0599fEOJga4Kq1M7KnxMaexa47aLgZgCn6MYVXfnByPqlzTaQGl15pECaAHwQoAEz0s2wEo-Z5cwylKwRwAVeR_FJoOiOiBnaLPMGOGX4zILOhY4H4CVhmmqfF3ZP4IWZ_sMY7sZk7RQCL-jwwd3awGEtm23vSS40A\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/37d3SrJKgCM/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Close your eyes for a moment. Do you remember that sweet, fleeting childhood wish? The one where you wore a white apron, stood in a sunlit kitchen filled with the scent of vanilla, and dreamed of baking every magical pastry in the world? As we grew up, busy days made us forget the simple magic of flour and sugar. 🌸\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBut your journey begins anew on a softly raining afternoon, inheriting your grandmother\\u0026#39;s recipe book in her old bakery. No timers, no stress—just the aroma of butter and soothing lofi melodies. But wait, look closer! Tucked between the pages is a dash of drama. With every special recipe you unlock, you\\u0026#39;ll uncover quirky town secrets and delightful mysteries. Open Dream Recipe: Merge Cooking, brew some tea, and relax. It’s not just a merge game; it’s a gentle time machine bringing your childhood fantasy back to life in a peaceful—and wonderfully mysterious—world. 🎀\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith simple taps, dive into a magical merge cooking experience. Drag and merge food to whip up tasty dishes. Start with classic comforting pastries, but soon your menu will expand to explore global cuisines! Every match in this merge puzzle brings delightful, mouth-watering surprises. 🍧\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAs you master your craft, you will unlock diverse food themes—from a cozy morning breakfast menu and sweet pastel desserts to savory street food and elegant fine dining. Welcome hungry customers who bring heartwarming stories about love and life, not just orders. 💖\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover your peaceful haven:\\u003cbr\\u003e🍰 Relaxing Merge Games: Effortlessly tap and merge items in this cozy game to completely unwind.\\u003cbr\\u003e🍰 Master Global Cuisines: Collect ingredients to unlock hundreds of recipes across exciting cooking games stages.\\u003cbr\\u003e🍰 Diverse Food Themes: Expand your menu with exciting culinary chapters, exploring different tastes and flavors from around the world.\\u003cbr\\u003e🍰 Special Events: Join stress-free seasonal events to win rare ingredients and special culinary rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e🍰 Healing Story: Enjoy slice-of-life narratives from lovable customers that feel like a warm hug.\\u003cbr\\u003e🍰 Lofi \\u0026amp; ASMR: Soft pastel graphics and calming sounds create the ultimate chill games vibe.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you crave relaxing games you can play entirely at your own pace, this is your safe haven. 🌸\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe warm lights are on, and the oven is ready. Download Dream Recipe: Merge Cooking today and write your peaceful culinary story! 🎀\"],\"HYSPIRE PTE. LTD.\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/S5SIz9zaepZZohO4dcI6NXKUGN7bU30gWZbf3eg3cyArWwklqmlDccMNl2UtqJb6OOZtoRaOxt-QhBDxMHxm\"],null,[246,231,205,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOV