wa1hs0Go4ZLTDXgQyUgTa1_m7TYx-z0G_eqGanc6nETcX2ozxaQ4d_NMYn7i5NRp9ttFp5L9tB9qlAhMUwzI_ITKJlw-d_H-pOSxc0NIf3AlCxIXKeUMghNqJJkXBLJKHz5fEgnEJA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ir4TMyazls8/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"🐾 Meet My Talking Slimy, a cute talking pet and virtual pet game where you can talk, play, feed, dress up, and relax with your own funny slime friend. Spend time with Slimy, hear playful reactions, sing together, enjoy mini-games, and discover a colorful slime game full of fun surprises.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🗣️ TALKING VIRTUAL PET\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🐱 Meet your new virtual friend! Slimy is a cheerful talking slime that can talk, sing, react, and keep you company. Speak to your pet, listen to funny responses, and discover playful reactions as you spend more time together.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery visit brings another chance to play, interact, and have fun with your talking pet.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍎 FEED AND CARE FOR YOUR PET\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake care of Slimy and keep your virtual pet happy. Choose tasty food such as apples and ginger, feed your slime friend, and watch the funny reactions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy simple virtual pet care at your own pace. Feed, play, relax, and spend time together whenever you want.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👗 DRESS UP AND CUSTOMIZE SLIMY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGive your virtual friend a completely new look. Discover playful outfits and accessories, add cat ears, a funny cow nose, and mix different items to create your favorite style.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomize Slimy, try new combinations, and turn your talking pet into a unique character that feels like your own.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 PLAY FUN MINI-GAMES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLooking for more ways to play? Jump into quick mini-games and casual activities with Slimy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay games, earn rewards, and discover entertaining challenges while spending time with your virtual pet. Whether you have a few minutes or want to play longer, there is always something fun to do.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌴 RELAX AND PLAY OFFLINE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake a break and enjoy relaxing moments with your slime friend. Hang out by the virtual pool, play at your own pace, or simply spend a quiet moment together.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith offline play and Do Not Disturb mode, My Talking Slimy is an easy casual game to enjoy wherever you are.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💚 WHY PLAY MY TALKING SLIMY?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Cute talking pet with funny reactions\\u003cbr\\u003e• Virtual pet care with feeding and playful activities\\u003cbr\\u003e• Dress-up outfits and character customization\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fun mini-games and casual challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e• Relaxing offline gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e• Colorful cartoon world\\u003cbr\\u003e• Your own interactive slime friend\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate fun moments with your own talking virtual pet. Feed Slimy, choose new outfits, customize your friend, play mini-games, and enjoy a relaxing pet game filled with funny reactions and colorful activities.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart your virtual pet adventure and play with My Talking Slimy today!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMy Talking Slimy @mytalkingslimy #mytalkingslimy\"],\"Pixeland OU\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/plPJP4UNIqYvg4P2m-BiqXRiqGDRKZcpaQU0JhROrlKX2tjB53mVYeqbWNbqKpSQzV7BrChlzscaAdXneZXu\"],null,[167,209,33,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u0