ull,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.haoplay.game.gp.duck\"]],[\"qgJiGmAIYEoTCOi0hLLHkJcDFaoRgwMd/OULsPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNAoeChhjb20uaGFvcGxheS5nYW1lLmdwLmR1Y2sQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"RKK0gyt__3g\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:RKK0gyt__3g?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:RKK0gyt__3g\",null,[1920,1080],null,null,\"AXH1ezmrQ85JcXA_mEFKLIgurddY1NQvM8noYca7kxiipy0PW7C6_3m0Zw4v51qqT5Mwf5XJrgmrHWxY5evHtXXUbbSi6eQNCMF8FOuSXEFb1ozfvUi_EnX5OzlK-KlgfJ6v-UbTUJdKe7WF02jAj_9W6rQ4rqr2GirEOmPun0gQcByIzF4hrXZLYzA8FZdD8WycF1SNEyIoWcjhNIajTh8UWhAzGJ4ZMnb8pwgMlUXv--PGUdCcIgEF4XSVaKDtkc4Im3Q_ISZHv5pXwNdLpo4AoV1viuDdpLwCyD2_7z1cVLpeAw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RKK0gyt__3g/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"On the endless azure seas, a duck slowly awakens on the deck of a mysterious ark. Having lost your memories, you will transform into \\u0026quot;Captain Duck\\u0026quot;, taking the helm of this ship of miracles and shuttling through perilous fantasy islands! During your adventure, you will constantly encounter and rescue super-powered avian partners like the lightning-wielding Chicken Mage and the martial arts master Goose Fighter. Facing the surging monster waves and heavy traps, lead your adorable poultry army to smash monsters and difficulties using the most addictively satisfying \\u0026quot;Egg-Laying Slingshot\\u0026quot;. Outside of combat, gather resources, open mysterious eggs, dress up your partners as you please, decorate your cozy ark, and uncover the ultimate secrets of these waters!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCore Game Features\\u003cbr\\u003eRelaxing One-Handed Control, Infinite Slingshot for Satisfying Screen Clears\\u003cbr\\u003e No matter when or where, start a game in various scenes anytime, easily controlled with just one hand! Swipe your finger to draw the aim line, and release to shoot! Utilizing physical ricochets, achieve \\u0026quot;Infinite Slingshots\\u0026quot; amidst the monster hordes, and enjoy the ultimate stress-relieving thrill of instant screen clears!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e50+ Avian Heroes, Assemble Your Exclusive Squad \\u003cbr\\u003eRecruit over 50 super-powered avian heroes with unique skills! Freely mix and match across hundreds of meticulously designed stages to build your ultimate exclusive squad. Use clever \\u0026quot;Collision\\u0026quot; and \\u0026quot;Combo\\u0026quot; mechanics to unleash flashy Combos, leaving your enemies defenseless!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStrategic Build Paths, Mix and Match Fire and Lightning Elements\\u003cbr\\u003eReject the cookie-cutter approach and freely construct diverse combat builds! Whether it\\u0026#39;s a \\u0026quot;Fire\\u0026quot; lineup that triggers furious explosions or a \\u0026quot;Lightning\\u0026quot; lineup that electrocutes the whole screen, the rich elemental synergies make every battle full of strategy. Unlock personalized skins that not only look badass but also instantly boost massive Combat Power and stat bonuses!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMassive Progression System, Phantom Beast Formations to Help You Dominate An all-around Combat Power upgrading path! \\u003cbr\\u003eGears, cards, and gems are all available to satisfy all your collecting and progression desires. Diverse dungeon gameplay awaits your challenge: continuously break your limits in the \\u0026quot;Tower of Purgatory\\u0026quot;; activate the powerful \\u0026quot;Phantom Beast Formation\\u0026quot; to summon phantom beasts to aid you in battle; challenge the \\u0026quot;Endless Mode\\u0026quot; where strategy is king, or enjoy a moment of leisure time at the \\u0026quot;Fishing Ground\\u0026quot;!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCasual and AFK-Friendly, Massive Perks and Egg-Opening Carnival\\u003cbr\\u003eEasily acquire massive resources and enjoy the surprises and joy brought by the crazy \\u0026quot;Egg-Opening\\u0026quot; blind boxes! Enjoy plenty of premium perks upon logging in, with a chance to get hidden top-tier S-class heroes for free. Even when offline and AFK, the crew on the ark will automatically patrol and collect supplies for you, protecting your liver and keeping you from falling behind!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe world is about to sink, and the ark\\u0026#39;s engines are roaring! Captain, please board the ship immediately, download the game, and use the most addictive way to smash the apocalypse with your avian army!\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Us on Discord: https://discord.com/invite/quackquackattack\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/playquackquackattack\\u003cbr\\u003eTwitter: https://x.com/QuackAttackEN\\u003cbr\\u003eYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@QuackQuackAttack-official\"],\"HaoPlay Limited\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LcxhQdC4TnsMd1MdjwH7MdT2De1ODy-5QlXnY6pjUXaSPU7641IUlO2pVKZwVKc5bC9naYe_WM9LRJ0_YKjM\"],null,[188,146,125,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Moderate Violence\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.haoplay.game.gp.duck\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.haoplay.game.gp.duck\\u0026featur